<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Crown Cork upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Crown Cork upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it upgraded Crown Cork &amp; Seal Co Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- set a one-year price target of $70 a share.</p>
<p>-- expects Crown Cork to earn $3.40 a share in 1997 and $4.50 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- said industry fundamentals are strong.</p>
<p>-- Crown Cork gained 1-1/8 to 54-7/8.</p>
</text>
